    "en": {
      "title": "Häny HCM 100",
      "h1": "Häny HCM 100",
      "description": "High Shear Mixer HCM 100. The colloidal mixer is particularly suitable for the production of suspensions consisting of water, cement, ultra-fine binder, bentonite, sand, and other materials. A robust ",
